WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.633
Meet Skrivist, a quieter home for your EPUBs.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:11.633
Bring your books into one calm cloud library, then read without the noise.

00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:17.633
Tune the page, choose a theme, and let the interface disappear.

00:00:17.933 --> 00:00:24.633
Switch to read aloud, add ambient sound, and keep reading offline.

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:32.833
Start on one device, continue on another. Skrivist. Read free, or sync with Skrivist Cloud.
